{title: Build My Life}
{subtitle: Nr. 171 · English}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}
{key: E}
{comment: Verse 1}
[E]Worthy of ev'ry song [A]we could ever sing.
[E/G#]Worthy of all the praise [A]we could ever bring.
[E]Worthy of ev'ry breath [A]we could ever breathe.
[E/G#]We live for [A]You.

{comment: Verse 2}
[E]Jesus, the name above [A]ev'ry other name.
[E/G#]Jesus, the only one [A]who could ever save.
[E]Worthy of ev'ry breath [A]we could ever breathe.
[E/G#]We live for [A]You.

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Holy, there is no one like [F#m]You, there is none be[E]sides You.
Open up my eyes in [C#m7]wonder and
[A]show me who You are and [F#m]fill me with Your heart and
[E]lead me in Your love to [C#m7]those around me.
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Bridge (repeat as in source)}
[A]I will build my [B]life upon Your [C#m7]love; it is a [E/G#]firm foundation.
[A]I will put my [B]trust in You a[C#m7]lone, and I will [E/G#]not be shaken.

{comment: Words/music: Pat Barrett, Matt Redman, Brett Younker, Kirby Kaple, Karl Martin · © 2016 (see source)}
